<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Hello, dear Tamers!

Today I bring you the perfect macro for farmin Seals! Particularly, I am talking about Cherrymon seals.

First, as always, it is recommended to have X2 1000% experience to lvl up, given that we will be on Canyon Desert and the Cherrymons there are high lvl. Second, if you don't have a strong digi, use a +100% skill damage so you can insta kill every cherrymon.

Now, it is important to have the first skill on F1 and to have a DS disc on F6 so it can replenish your DS.

For this macro I already added the "4" so you can pick up the items inmediatly, but if you have a Magentic ID, then it won't be needed.

Farewell! Good luck with the drops!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 43 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 43 1
Delay 1200 ms
KeyDown 58 1
Delay 64
